  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士Gundam GQuuuuuuX』(ジークアクス)より、「リック・ドム ガイア機/オルテガ機」をHGで立体化！",
      "en": "From \"Mobile Suit Gundam GQuuuuuuX \" (Zeke Ax), \" Rick Dom Gaia machine/Ortega machine\" is made into a three-dimensional HG!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 劇中の動きが再現できる可動性。",
      "en": "• Mobility that allows you to reproduce the movements in the play."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 高機動形態へは差し替えなしで変形可能。",
      "en": "• Can be transformed into high mobility mode without replacement."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ジャイアント・バズが付属し、グリップが可動。",
      "en": "• Giant Buzz is included and the grip is movable."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 電磁ハーケンにはリード線を使用。",
      "en": "• Use lead wire for electromagnetic Harken."
    }
  ],
